id: pm-jiv3dw
title: Dogfood test failure must not print inherited environment secrets
description: "A failing spawnSync mock-call equality assertion renders the entire inherited process environment in Vitest output, leaking credentials into ignored local diagnostic logs. Assert only selected safe fields and prove a forced mismatch cannot echo a sentinel secret."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
