author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Replace broad mock-call equality with scalar safe assertions; a forced failure does not echo a secret sentinel; tracked and local secret scans pass.
parent: pm-doxj
severity: high
environment: Local dogfood test with inherited credentials in process.env
repro_steps: Force a mismatch in the full-success-path spawnSync mock call assertion in tests/unit/scripts/dogfood-package-first.spec.ts; Vitest expands env in the failure diff.
resolution: Check the synthetic inherited sentinel on every child spawn using scalar assertions.
expected_result: Every child inherits intended environment while failed assertions cannot print unrelated inherited secrets.
actual_result: Dogfood test suite 39/39 passed and static quality passed; hosted CI rerun pending.
