  "2026-09-24T00:45:14.039Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all-status PM items for dogfood test environment leak and redaction; existing dogfood and security items are closed and none owns this failing assertion. Local ignored diagnostic was replaced with a redacted summary after scanner detection; no secret values are recorded here."
  "2026-09-24T00:47:29.394Z","harness:codex","Evidence: Trivy found three critical token signatures in an ignored local Vitest failure log generated by whole mock-call equality diff; the log was replaced with a redacted summary and targeted secret scan passes. The assertion now compares only PM_TELEMETRY_DISABLED. A deliberate mismatch with an inherited synthetic sentinel verifies the diagnostic excludes the sentinel. Focused dogfood suite passes 39/39, tracked-file secret scan passes. This item contains no credential values."
  "2026-09-24T00:51:58.821Z","harness:codex","Final verification: the ignored local diagnostic file now contains only a redacted summary. Targeted Trivy secret scan of that file passed. Repository Trivy scan excluding ignored caches reports zero HIGH/CRITICAL vulnerability, secret, or misconfiguration findings; tracked-file secret checker and TypeScript typecheck passed. The 39-test dogfood suite includes a deliberate mismatch with a synthetic inherited secret and passed."
  "2026-09-24T01:46:56.205Z","harness:codex","PR #1293 recurrence: assert the synthetic inherited secret sentinel survives every child spawn using scalar checks only. Focused dogfood tests passed without expanding inherited environment in failure output."
